cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use mrv-lib in your research or governance work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "mrv-lib: Model Risk Validator"
abstract: >
  mrv-lib is an open-source Python library for quantitative model validation.
  It implements representation-invariance (Paper 1) and resolution-invariance
  (Paper 2) tests that measure how stable a model's regime labels are across
  admissible specifications, supporting SR 26-2 / OCC Bulletin 2026-13
  (formerly SR 11-7) model risk management workflows.
